{
  "_comment": [
    "One owner per mechanism, declared. Every hook this plugin ships is listed here with",
    "the mechanism it owns and the hand-wired spellings of that same mechanism that came",
    "before it. `jstack-host doctor` reads this file: a spelling under `replaces` still",
    "wired in ~/.claude/settings.json is the same machinery running twice, and a shipped",
    "hook missing from this file is an undeclared owner — both are reported.",
    "",
    "Why this file exists: on 2026-09-24 the compact-on-delivery port shipped while the",
    "hand-wired copy stayed in settings.json. Their locks could not see each other, so a",
    "delivered turn got /compact twice — the second landing on the summary the first had",
    "just produced — and each copy read the other's keystroke as the user's own turn and",
    "sent no continue. Session 244ca668 compacted twice at 04:10 and again at 04:22 UTC.",
    "Nothing on the machine could answer whether a mechanism had two owners."
  ],
